{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a father trying to guide his children to safety through a terrifying, creature-infested world. You can command them to follow you or stay hidden, but every choice could mean life or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person stealth horror experience,\u00a0 you can\u2019t fight back. Your only defense is staying quiet, moving carefully, and finding safe routes through the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: reach the safe zone <strong>with your family alive</strong>. If you escape alone, you fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patience, timing, and courage are your only tools for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your children to follow or hide to avoid danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense stealth gameplay with no combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric horror and sound-driven tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple paths and unpredictable creature encounters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Warning:</strong><br> Contains depictions of fear, death, and loud screams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Credits: </strong><br> Voice Acting by\u00a0TK Billington</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087030?t=1760676134","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087030?t=1760676134","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087030/5faa0c53598d29d826a9cfd7e99ba65a456ac742/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760676134","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087030/5faa0c53598d29d826a9cfd7e99ba65a456ac742/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760676134","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Death of characters in the game, screams, crying. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a father trying to guide his children to safety through a terrifying, creature-infested world. You can command them to follow you or stay hidden, but every choice could mean life or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person stealth horror experience,\u00a0 you can\u2019t fight back. Your only defense is staying quiet, moving carefully, and finding safe routes through the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: reach the safe zone <strong>with your family alive</strong>. If you escape alone, you fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patience, timing, and courage are your only tools for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your children to follow or hide to avoid danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense stealth gameplay with no combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric horror and sound-driven tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple paths and unpredictable creature encounters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Warning:</strong><br> Contains depictions of fear, death, and loud screams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Credits: </strong><br> Voice Acting by\u00a0TK Billington</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Dream Dimension"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as